  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/03/IMG_20210306_125723.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>La ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado se ha confeccionado una mural con cientos de fotos de mujeres tafarreras,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/03/Mural8Mtoga.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>que se ha colgado en la fachada del Ayuntamienbto provisional en la Casa de Cultura, tras</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/03/IMG_20210306_125626.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>la lectura de un manifiesto.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acto8mtogacomunidadamigable/IMG_20210306_111041.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210306_111041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acto8mtogacomunidadamigable/IMG_20210306_121840.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210306_121840\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acto8mtogacomunidadamigable/IMG_20210306_121847.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210306_121847\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acto8mtogacomunidadamigable/IMG_20210306_121901.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210306_121901\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acto8mtogacomunidadamigable/IMG_20210306_121908.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210306_121908\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acto8mtogacomunidadamigable/IMG_20210306_121922.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210306_121922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acto8mtog